			"Message": "fix(Maintain): Restore GitHub badge table and funding logos in README\n\nThe prior cleanup (82c6ec5) stripped the GitHub metrics badge table (stars, issues, downloads, last-commit) and the NLnet/NGI0/PlayForm funding logo row to streamline the document. Restore both as semantic HTML tables — shields.io badges with dark/light mode support at the document header, and SVG partner logos with clickable links in the Funding section — while preserving the structural improvements from that refactor.\n\nAlso reflow all paragraph and list prose with consistent 88-character line wrapping for improved readability in source form without altering the content.",
			"SHA": "4c6dd152e1fd4ec6b5e5b7a9d7d96db56634e744"
